Yaru folder icons, cut out of Ubuntu's source sheet
(icons/src/fullcolor/accented-full/places/folders.svg,
https://github.com/ubuntu/yaru) by tools/import-yaru-places.py, and
recoloured by xl-Cheeselooks (front and back may differ, which Yaru's own
colours don't).

Copyright: Canonical Ltd and the Yaru contributors
