https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

These files, and the recoloured copies the Tool writes from them, are under
the same licence. The rest of xl-Cheeselooks is GPL-3.0 or later.


--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Some icons here (the ones Yaru does not draw: recent, saved search, network, workgroup, bookmarks) are this style's folder with
the picture from the matching Mint-Y icon, made by tools/compose-missing-places.py.
Those pictures are from Mint-Y (https://github.com/linuxmint/mint-y-icons),
CC BY-SA 4.0, by Sam Hewitt and Alexey Varfolomeev.
